  (text_box "SGC P1 - ANNA-B402 carrier, 22x55 mm 4-layer (0.8 mm, ENIG) - rev A-WIP - 2026-10-29\nGenerated from sgc_schematic_spec.md v0.1 (92b352e). Every pin/net traceable to the spec;\nTBD-JP items appear as notes only - nothing invented. Regenerate: python3 gen_symbols.py && python3 gen_schematic.py"
    (at 140 14 0) (size 165 12)
    (stroke (width 0.0) (type dash))
    (fill (type none))
    (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left top))
    (uuid 0a49e87b-6d9b-43c5-a3ac-c22ca57afb63)
  )
  (text_box "ANTENNA KEEPOUT (SIM UBX-21000517 App.B p.70): no traces/vias in ANY layer in the antenna strip clearance area.\nInternal antenna: ANT_INT(5)-ANT(6) bridge. Corner placement -> ANT_PCB(1) = GND pattern, ANT_GND1/2 (2,3) NC.\nStackup must be checked vs u-blox reference (certification). Keep U8/IS31 clear of antenna strip (IS31 ds EMI note)."
    (at 160 72 0) (size 132 17)
    (stroke (width 0.0) (type dash))
    (fill (type none))
    (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left top))
    (uuid 034a23db-e3f2-4b57-84a1-ed04b79e190d)
  )
  (text_box "CHARGER (spec 4.1/4.7): ISET 1.82k -> ICHG ~110 mA; ILIM 1k -> 200 mA; IPRETERM 4.99k -> 10%; VBATREG default 4.2 V.\nOD-8: /CD -> P0.08 (B402 pin 50, moved from P0.25 - P0.25 does not exist) + 100k PU to V_PMID (ship-mode capable).\nBQ INT -> 100k PU +1V8, NC on MCU (read FAULTS reg, AD-029); /PG TP only. /MR, RESET NC (Nicla P0.18->MR net dropped, C3).\nLS/LDO unused (C4): LSCTRL->GND, VINLS->SYS, LS/LDO 1uF. TS: R_HI (VBUS->TS) + R_LO (TS->GND) + pack NTC - values TBD-JP (OD-4).\ni2c0 pull-ups 100k to +1V8 (Nicla parity; BQ ds suggests 10k - spec chose Nicla parity). USB-IF inrush note OD-14."
    (at 15 104 0) (size 132 26)
    (stroke (width 0.0) (type dash))
    (fill (type none))
    (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left top))
    (uuid 5bf9f6a2-0519-49a0-8f2a-64e36a9d185a)
  )
  (text_box "USB-C: VBUS 10uF bulk at connector; D+/D- NC; shell stitched to GND.\nESD D5 TBD-JP (OD-13: PESD5V0U2UT vs TPD4E05U06)."
    (at 15 86 0) (size 40 14)
    (stroke (width 0.0) (type dash))
    (fill (type none))
    (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left top))
    (uuid 6f3f6c51-ac1c-47ea-a462-d42f3c0ee5f9)
  )
  (text_box "GAUGE (spec 4.2, AD-029): addr 0x36 fixed; VDD(3)=VBAT sense +0.1uF; CELL(2) NC->GND; CTG/QSTRT->GND.\nALRT(5) OD -> 10k PU +1V8 -> P0.21 (B402 pin 26). OD-12: verify MAX17048 VIH vs 1.8 V pull-ups at review."
    (at 15 176 0) (size 44 16)
    (stroke (width 0.0) (type dash))
    (fill (type none))
    (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left top))
    (uuid 2fb92552-87df-476d-9290-119665d491c8)
  )
  (text_box "I2C MAP (spec 2):\ni2c0 power bus P0.15/P0.16 (PU 100k -> +1V8): 0x36 MAX17048, 0x53 IS31FL3194, 0x6A BQ25120A.\ni2c1 sensor bus P0.22/P0.23: 0x2A LDC1612 (DNP v2), 0x52 RV-3028-C7 (DNP v2, /INT -> TP)."
    (at 240 185 0) (size 68 24)
    (stroke (width 0.0) (type dash))
    (fill (type none))
    (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left top))
    (uuid 713141fc-b51d-4372-aa45-ebbe216e84d8)
  )
  (text_box "BHI CLUSTER (spec 4.4): BMP390L/BMM150/BME688 are sub-sensors on BHI M1 master port - exact M1/M2/M3 wiring = COPY\nABX00050 (Nicla) at capture (TBD-JP). BME688 DNP per OD-6 (footprint retained). H-IF SPI 16 MHz (app.overlay) on\nP0.03-05 despite Table 4 low-freq remark - risk R1: drop to 8/4 MHz if RF regressions. RESETN -> P0.13 (moved, C3/OD-7).\nHOSTBOOT(3) NC v1 (TBD-JP vs Nicla); VREG(6) NC v1 (decoupling per Bosch ds - TBD-JP, not in spec 6); RESV1-3 NC (do not connect)."
    (at 282 100 0) (size 122 22)
    (stroke (width 0.0) (type dash))
    (fill (type none))
    (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left top))
    (uuid c2cee017-7266-4740-98de-ff665a32cebb)
  )
  (text_box "LED (spec 4.3): U5 VCC/SDB -> V_PMID (OD-17: confirm SDB net on ABX00050 at capture); decap value TBD-JP.\nIS31 OUT1-3 are current sinks - verify SMLP34RGB2W3 common polarity at capture (spec text says anodes to OUTs)."
    (at 352 148 0) (size 48 16)
    (stroke (width 0.0) (type dash))
    (fill (type none))
    (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left top))
    (uuid af054726-23e8-48fc-9be1-95bacde56b15)
  )
  (text_box "FLASH: U7 = RawRunStore 8 MB (flash layout per hardware doc). U2 = BHI FW flash (Arduino_BHY2 upload) -\nOD-5: ADD U2 to BOM (Nicla parity, populated; missing from BOM v4.3). WP#/HOLD# NC -> internal PU (Macronix Note 1).\nU7/U2 decap 100n = Nicla parity (TBD-JP keep, spec 6)."
    (at 352 196 0) (size 48 22)
    (stroke (width 0.0) (type dash))
    (fill (type none))
    (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left top))
    (uuid 03b09d4b-6141-4889-8821-4915030d7c99)
  )
  (text_box "PERIPHERALS / v2 DNP (spec 2/4.3/4.6/4.8):\nSK6812-mini x5 strip: DIN <- P0.19 (B402 pin 38) through dual-supply level translator (VCCA +1V8 / VCCB +5V,\nTXB0102/TXS0102-class - part TBD-JP, OD-9). Strip supply +5V from MT3608 boost (EN -> P0.17 = B402 pin 49, moved\nfrom P0.24 - does not exist; OD-9b: keep P0.19 vs move to full-drive GPIO - decide after R2 bench).\nBoost BOM (hw doc 7.3): L 4.7uH/2A, Cin 10uF, Cout 22uF, Rfb 75k/10k, Cff 22pF. NOT drawn - capture at layout.\n32k: Y1 SIT1532AI (OD-10 default FIT) -> XL1 (pin 17); XL2 (18) -> GND; Y1 decap TBD-JP. LFRC-only = EVK alternative.\nUART console TP: TX P0.20 (pin 10) / RX P0.09 (pin 22, NFC1 - no NFC coil on board). TP set per OD-3:\n+1V8, +5V, VBAT, V_PMID, GND, BQ INT, SWD row, UART row, ALRT, LED-data.\nDNP v2 (footprints retained): LDC1612 U6 + 14mm coil (ADDR=GND -> 0x2A; INTB -> BUTTON net per OD-11; CLKIN tie\nGND if internal osc - v2), RV-3028-C7 @0x52 (/INT -> TP, no GPIO steal), BZ1 beeper (P0.09 via 100R/NPN).\nnRF P0.24/P0.25 DO NOT EXIST on B402 (spec C1/C2 pin moves). Module USB (pins 21/34/35) unused - NC."
    (at 125 185 0) (size 105 46)
    (stroke (width 0.0) (type dash))
    (fill (type none))
    (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left top))
    (uuid b67021c6-8c3d-4590-a12e-3396590c4dfa)
  )
  (text_box "BATTERY / POWER TREE (spec 4.8/5): Renata ICP622540PMT 600 mAh 3.7 V LiPo, 3-wire NTC pack, JST-3 user-replaceable\n(connector PN TBD-JP, OD-4; pinout per ABX00050 = VBAT/NTC/GND). VSYS is the +1V8 rail (buck default 1.8 V, 300 mA).\nVBAT -> MAX17048 VDD only. V_PMID -> IS31FL3194. Charge 110 mA + system ~25 mA + LED ~23 mA bat-side = 158 mA < ILIM 200 mA.\nSession ~48 mAh -> ~12.5 sessions (hw doc 7); gauge adds ~3 uA (AD-029). Battery capacity 600 mAh per docs (OD-4 confirm)."
    (at 15 216 0) (size 110 30)
    (stroke (width 0.0) (type dash))
    (fill (type none))
    (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left top))
    (uuid 49975ad7-894a-40e9-866c-954257899d05)
  )
  (text_box "J3 = ARM Cortex Debug 2x5 1.27 mm: 1 VTref(+1V8) 2 SWDIO 3 GND 4 SWDCLK 5 GND 6 SWO 7 KEY-NC 8 TDI-NC 9 GND 10 nRESET(=RESET_N, B402 pin 12 - nothing else on pin 12 except TP).\nOD-2: Tag-Connect TC2050 footprint alternative (castellated pads). SWO = B402 pin 16 (optional)."
    (at 15 274 0) (size 92 14)
    (stroke (width 0.0) (type dash))
    (fill (type none))
    (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left top))
    (uuid 358aa954-e47a-48df-98c9-58af17d8e9fc)
  )
  (text_box "U6 LDC1612 = DNP v2 footprint (unpopulated v1, spec 1/4.6). Coil = 14 mm spiral on CH0 (footprint retained, v2)."
    (at 196 240 0) (size 52 16)
    (stroke (width 0.0) (type dash))
    (fill (type none))
    (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left top))
    (uuid 42cbe80f-16cb-4bd8-a4e1-aa3e7e2b0e47)
  )

